; Desktop Subsystem for Android (DSA)
; The guest's sensors HAL (/vendor/bin/hw/dsa-sensors) runs in the platform's sensors HAL
; domain, labelled by vendor_file_contexts, which already lets it serve
; android.hardware.sensors.ISensors/default and write the framework's event queue. It reads the
; host's sensors over vsock, from the host's sensor port; this rule lets it open that
; connection.

(allow hal_sensors_server self (vsock_socket (create connect read write getattr setopt getopt shutdown)))
